{"3104610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEGARACER QUANTUMRUSH", "steam_appid": 3104610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush - The Ultimate Open World Racing Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> is an immersive open-world kart racing game that sets a new standard for racing experiences. Set in the sprawling futuristic city of <strong>Mega City</strong>, players can enjoy a variety of game modes while driving unique karts and controlling animated, cartoon-style characters. Designed for players of all ages, the game offers rich content that satisfies both beginners and seasoned racers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.poster.avif?t=1755754073\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.webm?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.mp4?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> delivers more than just traditional racing. Experience endless fun with a wide range of modes, including.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Speed through the city streets of Mega City in high-intensity races that test your reflexes and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle Racing</strong>: Overcome complex barriers and traps in this strategic racing mode where careful planning leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown Battle</strong>: Capture the crown within the time limit and hold onto it until the end to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soccer Mode</strong>: An inventive mode that fuses racing with soccer—use your kart to drive the ball and score goals with your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Single and Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Explore Mega City to discover over 10 unique game modes and special events awaiting your challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Mega City and discover over ten unique modes and special events waiting to be challenged.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersion in VR with the Comfort of PC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/1c2bb671764425c5797af963cae27564.poster.avif?t=1755754073\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/1c2bb671764425c5797af963cae27564.webm?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/1c2bb671764425c5797af963cae27564.mp4?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable on both PC and VR platforms, <strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> is designed for comfortable, extended play sessions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Visual Processing</strong>: Our specially designed VR camera and gameplay systems minimize motion sickness, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Controls</strong>: Choose between immersive steering wheel-based VR control or relaxed gameplay using joysticks or keyboards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Input Support</strong>: Whether you prefer keyboard, mouse, gamepad, or VR controllers, all input types are fully supported and switch seamlessly depending on your setup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even without VR, the game offers a fully satisfying experience with smooth controls and dynamic visuals on standard PC environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kart and Character Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/0b6a51fbbbd64a88b234fac3f179a5a6.avif?t=1755754073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras_big/0b6a51fbbbd64a88b234fac3f179a5a6.avif?t=1755754073 width=800 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong>, players can freely customize their karts and characters.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kart Customization</strong>: Choose your favorite colors, parts, and design elements to create a kart that reflects your personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Styling</strong>: Equip adorable characters with various outfits and gear to express your unique flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Racing Experience for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/70d43922f7adbdd4a13fe7239c4a0537.poster.avif?t=1755754073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/70d43922f7adbdd4a13fe7239c4a0537.webm?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> is built to be accessible and fun for everyone—from casual beginners to racing veterans.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Races</strong>: Compete in lively multiplayer races or enjoy solo mini-games. Explore every corner of Mega City to discover hidden items and secrets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates with the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/e9ac406278d94b326cebd6acf17139d5.avif?t=1755754073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras_big/e9ac406278d94b326cebd6acf17139d5.avif?t=1755754073 width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> will continue to evolve through close communication with the community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular content updates will introduce new tracks, modes, and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beta tests and surveys will gather feedback to shape a better and more engaging game environment.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start Your Race in the World of Mega City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/b648813032a04afc9e5e4df4cf61ec4c.avif?t=1755754073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras_big/b648813032a04afc9e5e4df4cf61ec4c.avif?t=1755754073 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the dream of becoming the ultimate racer in a world of speed and strategy. Race through the streets of Mega City, conquer unique challenges, and define your own racing style. <strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> offers a new level of casual racing fun that anyone can enjoy—regardless of platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush - The Ultimate Open World Racing Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> is an immersive open-world kart racing game that sets a new standard for racing experiences. Set in the sprawling futuristic city of <strong>Mega City</strong>, players can enjoy a variety of game modes while driving unique karts and controlling animated, cartoon-style characters. Designed for players of all ages, the game offers rich content that satisfies both beginners and seasoned racers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.poster.avif?t=1755754073\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.webm?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3104610/extras/7e4ce710d93b3f012228573ffd950677.mp4?t=1755754073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MegaRacer QuantumRush</strong> delivers more than just traditional racing. Experience endless fun with a wide range of modes, including.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Street Racing</strong>: Speed through the city streets of Mega City in high-intensity races that test your reflexes and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle Racing</strong>: Overcome complex barriers and traps in this strategic racing mode where careful planning leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra